    "category": "sliders-carousels",
    "isReactBits": false,
    "description": "Full-height WebGL slideshow of tilted image tiles in an endless vertical loop. The focused image hangs like cloth blowing in the wind, and scrolling or dragging snaps to the nearest slide.",
