        "Vertical list of image tiles rendered on a WebGL canvas, tilted by a camera angle"
    ],
    "behavior": [
        "Wheel and drag move the loop with easing, then snap to the closest slide",
        "Active slide is a cannon.js cloth simulation with gravity and noise-driven wind",
        "Wind direction follows the mouse on desktop",
        "Slides fade between idle and focus opacity by distance from center or on hover",
        "Wheel events on the component are captured and default scrolling is prevented"
    ],
